---
// Intro breve (≈1,3 s) solo la primera visita. Si falla el JS, se oculta sola (ver Base.astro).
---
<div class="intro" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="intro__disc"></span>
  <span class="intro__mark display"><span class="intro__in">Carlos Fernández</span></span>
</div>
<style>
  .intro { display: none; }
  :global(html.intro-on) .intro {
    position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 200; display: grid; place-items: center;
    background: var(--noche); overflow: hidden;
  }
  .intro__disc {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; width: 30vmax; aspect-ratio: 1; margin: -15vmax 0 0 -15vmax;
    border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); transform: scale(0);
  }
  .intro__mark { position: relative; overflow: hidden; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6vw, 3.4rem); color: var(--on-accent); padding: 0.1em 0; }
  .intro__in { display: block; }
</style>
